  "solution": "Given: Birds, Ostriches, Bats\n\n**Birds **is a broad category that includes many types of flying and non-flying birds.\n\n**Ostriches **are a specific type of bird, so they are a subset of the \"Birds\" category.\n\n**Bats** are not birds; they are mammals that can fly.\n\nThe best possible diagram: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/546519eb0cfc9ababdf2f712dcc6aeda698bbe4cb02852e7e8394928e4e743fe.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9be35cff627fb2643ff17875ee310f51bdd1053056d2a3a327251e52e8d13d4f.png] \n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 3\".**",
